  message: "CORRECTION to my correction just above: v8 is NOT clean of catalogued receivers. Its 19 test/mjsunit/asm files that construct a WebSocket (emscripten-generated bundles, e.g. test/mjsunit/asm/embenchen/box2d.js) each carry one peer.socket.onmessage = ... (19 sites), where ws = new WebSocket(url, opts) (:4265) is stored as an object-literal field { socket: ws } (:4276) and the handler is assigned through peer.socket. That is a field-bound receiver reached through an object literal rather than this, so it is outside the analyzer's typing as well. The v8 analyzer census count (0 assignment edges) stands; the claim that none of its spellings sit on a catalogued receiver was wrong and is withdrawn."  # 3a67
