  message: "RECLASSIFICATION in the WI-zohuk sizing above, after reading each site: nestjs/nest integration/websockets/e2e/gateway.spec.ts:135 is an ANNOTATED outer let (let eventSource: EventSource; at :106, eventSource = new EventSource(...) at :127), not a plain one; and lila ui/lib/src/socket.ts:326 (ws.onerror = ws.onclose = ws.onopen = ws.onmessage = () => {} after const ws = this.ws) is a local alias of a field. Final tally over the 36 files: emitted 4; plain outer-let assignment 4; annotated outer let 5; field or field alias 6; chained declarator 2; not a typing gap (factory return, wrapper class) 6. Typable 21, emitted 4, missed 17. Record: docs/measurements/0030-js-handler-assignment-corpus-delta.md on branch jgstern-agent/docs/zohuk-handler-assignment-measurement."  # 8f63
